WEBVTT

01:18.620 --> 01:21.930
[Love Has Fireworks]

01:21.980 --> 01:24.900
[Episode 3]

01:26.920 --> 01:29.480
[Hiring with High Salary]

01:37.430 --> 01:39.960
Sir, let's wait until
she takes her medicine.

01:42.400 --> 01:43.210
Thank you.

01:43.870 --> 01:46.130
Slow down when you swallow. Don't choke.

01:58.520 --> 01:59.780
Here. A heat pad.

02:01.490 --> 02:02.830
You know quite a lot.

02:04.500 --> 02:06.900
Don't think I don't know
how you women work.

02:07.690 --> 02:08.930
Look at you.

02:08.979 --> 02:10.389
You knew you'd get cramps,

02:10.389 --> 02:12.590
and you still didn't prepare anything.

02:13.770 --> 02:15.870
It's not like it happens every month.

02:16.060 --> 02:19.050
It's probably because
I've had a lot on my mind lately.

02:19.050 --> 02:19.980
I'm telling you.

02:19.990 --> 02:20.910
You have to take care of yourself first.

02:20.910 --> 02:23.840
That's the only way
to fight for what you want. Got it?

02:24.320 --> 02:25.260
Got it.

02:26.590 --> 02:27.390
Let's go, Sir.

02:33.040 --> 02:34.360
[Repair in progress]

02:34.760 --> 02:35.840
What's going on?

02:40.140 --> 02:41.950
Shoot. The elevator's broken.

02:43.510 --> 02:44.810
Let's take the stairs.

02:44.840 --> 02:45.790
Can you make it?

02:46.050 --> 02:47.450
We can't just wait here.

02:50.790 --> 02:51.720
Come on, come on.

02:53.880 --> 02:55.560
Thanks for everything today.

02:56.150 --> 02:57.670
You bought me medicine,

02:58.820 --> 03:01.280
took me home, and carried my stuff.

03:01.720 --> 03:02.970
No need to thank me.

03:04.050 --> 03:05.230
I'm just worried that since you're single,

03:05.230 --> 03:06.830
you wouldn't know who to call

03:07.150 --> 03:08.640
if you got seriously sick.

03:09.550 --> 03:11.040
Are you afraid I'll scam you?

03:11.040 --> 03:12.570
I'm not that kind of person.

03:12.960 --> 03:14.330
It's not like I won't
pay you back for the medicine.

03:14.330 --> 03:15.330
No need.

03:15.410 --> 03:16.460
It's not about the money.

03:16.460 --> 03:18.190
Save it for your medical bills.

03:18.620 --> 03:21.620
If money's no big deal,
then why do you need a roommate?

03:21.620 --> 03:23.480
Who said they couldn't afford it?

03:24.100 --> 03:26.430
And who just said
it's not about the money?

03:26.640 --> 03:28.440
Okay, enough.

03:28.460 --> 03:29.720
We're going in circles

03:30.500 --> 03:31.829
just like these stairs.

03:33.829 --> 03:37.690
[No stocking on public stairs]

03:34.350 --> 03:35.480
We're finally here.

03:43.950 --> 03:45.820
The elevator's working again?

03:50.600 --> 03:54.370
[Fire Hydrant]

03:58.470 --> 03:59.720
What the heck?

04:02.190 --> 04:02.790
Oh my gosh!

04:05.180 --> 04:06.760
Someone left the faucet on!

04:11.140 --> 04:12.430
Here, let me help you.

04:19.980 --> 04:21.600
What are you doing? Go get the mop!

04:21.600 --> 04:22.260
Okay, okay.

04:29.520 --> 04:31.200
Push it inward.

04:31.450 --> 04:33.270
There's a floor drain in the bathroom.

04:33.270 --> 04:35.030
Sweep it inward in this direction.

04:35.030 --> 04:36.630
I've never done this before.

04:38.940 --> 04:41.580
Hold the mop like this, then push.

04:41.820 --> 04:42.550
These are...

04:43.240 --> 04:44.409
hardwood floors.

04:47.540 --> 04:48.540
Don't mop here.

04:48.560 --> 04:49.510
Go over there.

04:50.070 --> 04:51.930
Push it that way, toward this side.

04:51.930 --> 04:52.740
Okay, okay.

05:14.380 --> 05:16.140
My heart is bleeding.

05:30.190 --> 05:32.150
What happened here?

05:34.510 --> 05:35.430
What happened?

05:36.870 --> 05:38.000
Where have you been?

05:38.980 --> 05:40.650
I went to grab a coffee.

05:41.990 --> 05:42.790
What's wrong?

05:43.790 --> 05:46.050
Did you leave the faucet on when you left?

05:48.240 --> 05:49.480
The faucet?

05:51.120 --> 05:52.420
I can't remember.

05:53.390 --> 05:54.650
I don't think I used it.

05:54.790 --> 05:56.320
You don't think you used it?

05:56.850 --> 05:57.860
See for yourself.

05:58.690 --> 06:00.490
The floor, the rug,

06:00.830 --> 06:02.510
and the hardwood in both rooms—

06:02.510 --> 06:04.380
all soaked. It's still not dry.

06:23.730 --> 06:24.980
Hello, Xixi.

06:28.520 --> 06:30.980
I want to go to that store too.

06:31.710 --> 06:32.990
Are you nearby?

06:34.909 --> 06:36.630
I'm sorry. I didn't mean to.

06:36.630 --> 06:39.040
You didn't mean to. You were just clumsy.

06:39.750 --> 06:41.630
If this were my own place,

06:41.659 --> 06:42.920
I'd spoil you
and let you do whatever you want.

06:42.920 --> 06:45.670
But this is a rental. It's her flat.

06:45.830 --> 06:48.430
It's fine. It's all cleaned up anyway.

06:48.580 --> 06:50.980
Just be more careful next time.
No big deal.

06:51.520 --> 06:53.720
Li Yifei, you just won't stop, will you?

06:54.220 --> 06:56.020
Are you still mad about earlier?

06:56.460 --> 06:57.840
It's bad enough you roast me normally,

06:57.840 --> 07:00.640
but you're doing it right
in front of the landlord?

07:11.110 --> 07:12.770
Alright, I'm sorry, Qian Fei.

07:14.020 --> 07:15.340
Once I get paid,

07:16.500 --> 07:18.100
I'll cover the floor damage.

07:43.940 --> 07:45.230
I'll fix these two parts

07:45.230 --> 07:45.909
and send it to you.

07:45.909 --> 07:47.360
They really know how to cut it close.

07:47.360 --> 07:49.060
No need to clock me in. I'm already here.

07:49.060 --> 07:49.990
I'm downstairs.

07:51.100 --> 07:52.200
Okay. Thank you.

08:15.190 --> 08:16.740
Is she blind?

08:16.760 --> 08:18.050
Can't she see me?

08:26.230 --> 08:27.310
Li Yifei?

08:37.080 --> 08:38.350
[He Jing Securities Co., Ltd.]

08:37.309 --> 08:38.370
Let's get started.

08:42.070 --> 08:43.150
Is everyone here?

08:44.290 --> 08:45.500
Is there a problem?

08:45.680 --> 08:47.540
No, no, I just wanted to make sure.

08:48.060 --> 08:49.660
Alright, let's get started.

08:50.710 --> 08:52.350
First, let me go over

08:52.380 --> 08:54.080
the general situation
of Shanlifang Hotel Group's

08:54.080 --> 08:56.620
joint sponsorship project.

08:57.570 --> 08:58.940
It's co-sponsored by He Jing Securities

08:58.940 --> 09:00.970
and Zhizhong Capital,

08:59.850 --> 09:03.680
[Index]

09:01.030 --> 09:04.460
with both firms serving as
lead underwriters—Shanlifang Hotel Group

09:04.460 --> 09:06.260
is expected to issue 70 million shares.

09:06.260 --> 09:07.910
As for the issue price,

09:07.930 --> 09:10.120
it will fall between 25 yuan

09:10.150 --> 09:12.350
and 33.3 yuan per share.

09:12.620 --> 09:13.940
[Marketing Department]

09:12.760 --> 09:14.010
So that's Li Yifei?

09:14.040 --> 09:15.590
He's even better-looking in person
than in the photos.

09:15.590 --> 09:16.150
Yeah.

09:16.750 --> 09:17.830
So handsome.

09:18.280 --> 09:20.730
Xinyao, why didn't you go to the meeting?

09:22.520 --> 09:24.350
Qian Fei isn't in there either.

09:24.380 --> 09:25.690
How would it be my turn?

09:27.880 --> 09:31.350
About 10% will be used
for general corporate purposes.

09:31.630 --> 09:32.390
Boss,

09:32.670 --> 09:34.130
I'll step out for a moment.

09:48.110 --> 09:48.930
Be quick.

09:51.830 --> 09:54.140
[Qian Fei, 27, graduated with a Master's
degree from a famous financial college.]

09:54.170 --> 09:57.220
[She works in the
back-office department at He Jing.]

10:00.840 --> 10:01.280
[Qian Fei, 27, graduated with a Master's
degree from a famous financial college.]

10:01.310 --> 10:02.840
[I couldn't find her position before
because I only checked He Jing's]

10:02.860 --> 10:04.870
[marketing department. Who would've known
she was in the back-office department?]

10:05.480 --> 10:06.700
Sorry about that.

10:07.530 --> 10:08.170
It's fine.

10:08.190 --> 10:09.590
No worries. Take your time.

10:09.590 --> 10:11.250
Why don't we take a short break

10:11.250 --> 10:12.210
and continue in a moment?

10:12.210 --> 10:13.110
Sure.

10:19.690 --> 10:20.510
Qian Fei.

10:19.830 --> 10:21.470
[He Jing Securities Co., Ltd.]

10:22.800 --> 10:24.200
What did you do this time?

10:24.710 --> 10:25.640
What do you mean?

10:25.720 --> 10:27.620
If you didn't play dirty behind my back,

10:27.620 --> 10:30.360
why would Director Fang
keep me out of the meeting?

10:30.360 --> 10:31.740
I didn't do anything.

10:32.930 --> 10:34.010
Stop pretending.

10:34.030 --> 10:36.250
Just to get credit
in front of Director Fang,

10:36.250 --> 10:37.180
look at you—

10:37.430 --> 10:38.910
putting on such a show

10:38.930 --> 10:40.660
and pulling out all the tricks.

10:41.030 --> 10:42.090
And after all that,

10:42.360 --> 10:43.310
you're still just like me—

10:43.310 --> 10:45.400
not even qualified to sit in that meeting.

10:45.400 --> 10:47.470
You don't have to be so snarky.

10:47.520 --> 10:48.730
We're at work right now.

10:48.730 --> 10:49.640
If there's a misunderstanding,

10:49.640 --> 10:50.710
we can talk after work.

10:50.710 --> 10:51.640
Me being snarky?

10:53.320 --> 10:55.150
You speak quite softly,

10:56.000 --> 10:57.550
but who knows what you're plotting

10:57.550 --> 10:58.780
behind my back?

10:59.470 --> 11:00.540
Seriously, do you have some sort of

11:00.540 --> 11:01.800
persecution complex?

11:17.900 --> 11:19.100
What's going on here?

11:19.240 --> 11:20.900
He's our company's VIP guest.

11:20.910 --> 11:22.080
This is ridiculous!

11:22.230 --> 11:24.090
It's fine. Her hand just slipped.

11:24.760 --> 11:25.850
I'm so sorry.

11:26.800 --> 11:29.330
Go have Mr. Li's suit
sent to the dry cleaners.

11:30.100 --> 11:31.700
Make sure it's back
before the meeting is over.

11:31.700 --> 11:32.030
Okay.

11:32.050 --> 11:32.650
Thank you.

11:34.590 --> 11:36.580
Mr. Li, everything is ready over there.

11:36.580 --> 11:37.580
Shall we continue?

11:37.580 --> 11:39.190
It's ready? Let's go.

11:53.270 --> 11:54.600
So you're saying

11:54.620 --> 11:57.310
your current tenant, Li Yifei,

11:57.870 --> 12:00.470
is the project lead from Zhizhong Capital

12:00.500 --> 12:02.040
on the Shanlifang Hotel Project?

12:02.040 --> 12:04.070
I just found out too.

12:04.390 --> 12:06.910
Who would've thought
he'd be our project team's leader?

12:06.910 --> 12:09.140
It's probably because
Huang Shusong got arrested.

12:09.140 --> 12:10.520
Zhizhong was short-handed,

12:10.520 --> 12:11.500
so they had to bring him in.

12:11.500 --> 12:12.980
You absolutely cannot
tell anyone at the company

12:12.980 --> 12:15.070
that you two are living together.

12:16.080 --> 12:18.440
If anything goes wrong with this project,

12:18.540 --> 12:20.910
people will definitely say
you betrayed the firm

12:20.910 --> 12:22.370
and leaked trade secrets.

12:23.260 --> 12:24.720
That can't happen, can it?

12:25.230 --> 12:26.260
I can't be this unlucky

12:26.260 --> 12:27.910
every time I run into him, right?

12:27.910 --> 12:29.010
You know what?

12:29.030 --> 12:30.870
He actually helped me out a few times.

12:30.870 --> 12:32.310
So now I can't tell

12:32.340 --> 12:33.780
if it's good luck or bad.

12:34.780 --> 12:36.310
Just be careful from now on.

12:36.830 --> 12:38.460
Business has been rough this year.

12:38.460 --> 12:39.890
They say the layoffs are coming,

12:39.890 --> 12:40.660
and...

12:40.690 --> 12:43.750
it's going to start
with your back-office department.

13:04.680 --> 13:06.480
What's wrong? Do you want some?

13:08.330 --> 13:10.490
You mean this supermarket packaged bread?

13:10.490 --> 13:11.950
I have no interest in that.

13:24.300 --> 13:25.530
Well, sorry about that.

13:25.530 --> 13:27.010
I'll have her clean it up later.

13:27.010 --> 13:28.460
Well, well...

13:29.500 --> 13:31.240
You two had another fight?

13:32.210 --> 13:33.470
Who said we had a fight?

13:34.880 --> 13:37.540
There's no need to bicker
over a trivial matter.

13:38.190 --> 13:40.230
Look, the weather is so nice today.

13:40.390 --> 13:42.790
Go out for some air
and talk things through.

13:43.870 --> 13:44.830
As our landlord,

13:44.860 --> 13:47.190
aren't you getting a little too involved?

13:49.750 --> 13:50.950
Could you move aside?

13:53.070 --> 13:54.830
I'm cooking just fine on my own here.

13:54.830 --> 13:56.230
You came over on your own.

13:56.590 --> 13:57.800
If I don't talk to you,

13:57.820 --> 13:59.080
you'll feel slighted.

14:03.820 --> 14:06.250
She doesn't have time to go out with me.

14:06.760 --> 14:07.560
What's wrong?

14:08.230 --> 14:09.760
Is she busy on weekends too?

14:11.410 --> 14:13.440
Weekends? Not just on weekends.

14:13.660 --> 14:14.500
Her studio

14:14.530 --> 14:15.970
runs around the clock.

14:15.990 --> 14:18.250
Sometimes she shoots through the night.

14:18.630 --> 14:19.900
That's tough.

14:20.170 --> 14:22.480
I thought being a model was glamorous.

14:28.760 --> 14:29.240
Okay.

14:30.150 --> 14:31.150
I'm leaving.

14:31.930 --> 14:32.870
Leaving?

14:33.350 --> 14:35.630
What for? Are you going to the hotel
to ask for your deposit again?

14:35.630 --> 14:37.140
I can't get my deposit back.

14:37.140 --> 14:39.480
I'm going to return this wedding ring.

14:39.510 --> 14:41.450
It's never been worn,
and I still have the receipt.

14:41.450 --> 14:42.630
Getting a refund shouldn't be a problem.

14:42.630 --> 14:44.830
Just don't pull the sympathy act again.

14:46.830 --> 14:47.940
I already took my medicine.

14:47.940 --> 14:48.830
I'm fine now.

14:50.920 --> 14:53.080
Oh, by the way, I made too much breakfast.

14:53.080 --> 14:54.400
Help me finish it off.

14:57.150 --> 14:58.480
You want me to finish it?

14:58.980 --> 15:01.110
If you don't want it, just don't eat it.

15:02.390 --> 15:03.310
Well...

15:05.760 --> 15:07.420
Why don't you take it with you?

15:19.800 --> 15:20.860
It's so delicious.

15:27.880 --> 15:31.260
This brand has been really popular
with younger consumers lately.

15:31.260 --> 15:33.860
I think I've worked
with this designer before.

15:34.190 --> 15:35.450
He's got an eye for art.

15:35.510 --> 15:37.530
Do you want me to introduce him to you?

15:37.530 --> 15:38.410
Sure.

15:40.260 --> 15:41.580
Actually, I think

15:41.670 --> 15:42.670
you could do more

15:42.670 --> 15:44.800
than just being our brand ambassador.

15:46.750 --> 15:49.280
You'd make a creative consultant too.

15:49.410 --> 15:51.740
Isn't that Pretentious Li's girlfriend?

15:53.000 --> 15:55.200
I'm not that well known in the industry.

15:55.510 --> 15:57.030
I don't think I'm qualified.

15:57.030 --> 15:58.360
Getting famous is easy.

15:59.710 --> 16:01.970
Milan Fashion Week should be next month.

16:02.260 --> 16:03.660
Walk a runway show there,

16:03.950 --> 16:04.980
and you'll be famous overnight, right?

16:04.980 --> 16:05.660
Mi...

16:07.080 --> 16:07.840
Milan?

16:09.050 --> 16:09.850
Really?

16:10.550 --> 16:12.480
You absolutely have what it takes.

16:13.760 --> 16:16.960
But in this industry,

16:17.330 --> 16:19.680
talent alone isn't enough.

16:20.410 --> 16:21.810
You need an opportunity.

16:25.630 --> 16:27.070
And she told him she was just working.

16:27.070 --> 16:29.830
Turns out Li Yifei is a poor guy.

16:30.700 --> 16:32.290
Maybe I should show a little compassion

16:32.290 --> 16:33.870
and stop picking fights with him.

16:33.870 --> 16:35.870
Opportunities are made, not given.

16:37.600 --> 16:38.800
Let me take care of it.

16:40.440 --> 16:41.640
Thank you, Mr. Niu.

16:42.360 --> 16:43.750
Still calling me Mr. Niu?

16:43.750 --> 16:45.420
Thank you, Dong.

17:15.520 --> 17:17.000
Should I tell him

17:17.030 --> 17:18.650
I caught Gui Lili with someone else?

17:18.650 --> 17:19.980
He deserves to know.

17:20.460 --> 17:23.589
But it's their private business, and I...

17:24.000 --> 17:24.880
No, no.

17:24.900 --> 17:27.630
I can't get involved
in other people's business.

17:31.640 --> 17:32.700
What are you doing?

17:33.530 --> 17:34.290
Well...

17:34.640 --> 17:37.250
I wanted to ask if you'd like

17:37.280 --> 17:39.140
to have dinner together tonight.

17:39.790 --> 17:41.050
Have dinner together?

17:42.720 --> 17:43.720
What do you mean?

17:44.450 --> 17:46.280
Suddenly being so nice to me.

17:47.030 --> 17:48.790
You're up to something,
or planning a prank, right?

17:48.790 --> 17:49.950
Tell me, what do you want?

17:49.950 --> 17:51.180
You're impossible.

17:51.590 --> 17:54.250
Going halves on dinner
still costs money, okay?

17:54.510 --> 17:56.260
You want to make some extra cash?

17:56.260 --> 17:56.860
Fine.

17:57.920 --> 17:59.540
Then I'll order first.

17:59.570 --> 18:00.830
Let me try a few dishes.

18:00.990 --> 18:02.450
How about...

18:02.870 --> 18:04.730
scallion-braised sea cucumber,

18:04.780 --> 18:06.560
steamed egg custard with sea urchin,

18:06.560 --> 18:08.010
steamed Australian lobster,

18:08.010 --> 18:10.390
and free-range chicken soup.

18:10.590 --> 18:11.620
That's all for now.

18:11.620 --> 18:13.020
Order takeout yourself.

18:34.490 --> 18:35.420
Hello, Dad.

18:35.340 --> 18:40.060
[Microphone On] [Speaker On] [Camera On]

18:35.650 --> 18:36.690
Can you see me?

18:36.800 --> 18:37.870
Yes, I can.

18:38.640 --> 18:40.090
That's your new place, isn't it?

18:40.090 --> 18:41.090
Let me have a look.

18:41.870 --> 18:43.590
Well, I haven't finished unpacking yet.

18:43.590 --> 18:45.390
Let me show you once it's sorted.

18:46.390 --> 18:47.110
Okay.

18:47.380 --> 18:49.440
You must be very busy after moving in.

18:49.870 --> 18:50.870
But there's one thing

18:50.870 --> 18:52.690
we should talk about.

18:52.900 --> 18:54.530
Now that the housing situation is sorted,

18:54.530 --> 18:56.660
shouldn't both families

18:56.900 --> 18:57.980
sit down

18:58.010 --> 18:59.860
and discuss the wedding?

19:00.830 --> 19:02.620
There's no rush for that.

19:03.200 --> 19:04.740
What do you mean, no rush?

19:05.160 --> 19:06.490
Didn't you say

19:06.640 --> 19:08.050
you already booked
the wedding banquet venue?

19:08.050 --> 19:09.520
It's postponed now.

19:09.550 --> 19:11.900
Because we've both been quite busy lately.

19:11.900 --> 19:13.450
There's no time to plan.

19:14.620 --> 19:16.740
You may be busy, but we aren't.

19:16.950 --> 19:17.670
Alright, Dad.

19:17.670 --> 19:19.010
Don't worry about it, okay?

19:19.010 --> 19:21.140
I want to be in charge of my own wedding.

19:21.420 --> 19:22.680
Fine, I won't push you.

19:22.790 --> 19:24.990
Just keep track of the time yourselves.

19:25.350 --> 19:29.420
[Microphone On] [Speaker On] [Camera On]

19:25.450 --> 19:27.580
Okay, get some rest, both of you.

19:27.950 --> 19:28.740
Okay, I'm hanging up.

19:28.740 --> 19:29.540
Bye-bye, Dad.

19:52.660 --> 19:54.360
The quality of your door isn't very good.

19:54.360 --> 19:55.560
It's not soundproof.

19:55.700 --> 19:56.350
Really?

19:57.760 --> 20:00.020
I could hear every word of that call.

20:00.360 --> 20:03.620
We'll both have to keep it down
when we're on the phone then.

20:05.160 --> 20:06.090
About the breakup—

20:06.090 --> 20:07.970
the sooner
you tell your family, the better.

20:07.970 --> 20:10.100
Dragging it out won't solve anything.

20:11.060 --> 20:12.600
Even out of politeness,

20:12.800 --> 20:15.330
you should pretend
you didn't hear anything.

20:22.740 --> 20:24.740
Your eyes are red. Did you cry?

20:24.910 --> 20:25.590
Nope.

20:27.670 --> 20:28.790
If people

20:28.810 --> 20:31.020
didn't waste much energy on relationships,

20:31.020 --> 20:33.220
we would've evolved much faster by now.

20:36.370 --> 20:38.500
You should save that one for yourself.

20:38.680 --> 20:40.340
What's that supposed to mean?

20:40.630 --> 20:42.160
Nothing. I was just saying.

20:51.720 --> 20:53.520
Qian Fei, come over for a second.

20:56.750 --> 20:58.790
Why is HR looking for her?

21:01.120 --> 21:01.920
Manager.

21:02.110 --> 21:03.770
The layoff list was decided
by upper management.

21:03.770 --> 21:04.770
I wanted to keep you,

21:04.770 --> 21:06.170
but it was out of my hands.

21:06.800 --> 21:08.230
I just don't understand.

21:08.250 --> 21:09.920
There's nothing wrong with my performance.

21:09.920 --> 21:11.690
Why am I on the layoff list?

21:21.280 --> 21:23.190
I don't know what criteria they used.

21:23.190 --> 21:24.490
But since it's a layoff,

21:24.490 --> 21:25.840
someone has to leave.

21:27.110 --> 21:28.230
With your strong abilities

21:28.230 --> 21:29.960
and my recommendation letter,

21:30.040 --> 21:31.270
finding the same kind of role

21:31.270 --> 21:33.200
at another firm won't be a problem.

21:33.520 --> 21:35.610
There's no point staying here
just to be sidelined.

21:35.610 --> 21:38.120
If the company's severance pay is enough,

21:38.150 --> 21:39.440
you should just take it.

21:39.440 --> 21:41.070
Don't get into conflicts with the company.

21:41.070 --> 21:43.470
That will affect your future development.

21:50.360 --> 21:54.580
[Shanghai World Financial Center]

22:02.870 --> 22:03.920
Qian Fei,

22:05.150 --> 22:06.470
just a couple of days ago you thought

22:06.470 --> 22:08.330
you reached the peak of your life.

22:09.320 --> 22:12.250
Now you've lost both
your relationship and your job.

22:12.370 --> 22:14.630
You've really made your life into a joke.

22:17.470 --> 22:19.940
[Shanghai World Financial Center]

22:21.890 --> 22:23.180
Why is

22:23.680 --> 22:25.480
everything coming at me at once?

22:41.260 --> 22:42.810
What's she doing here?

22:48.120 --> 22:49.440
Qian Fei got fired?

22:50.080 --> 22:50.640
Yes.

22:51.520 --> 22:52.850
How did she end up on the list?

22:52.850 --> 22:55.310
It came from upper management, apparently.

23:01.710 --> 23:02.670
Go get Xinyao.

23:03.180 --> 23:03.700
Okay.

23:06.110 --> 23:11.170
[He Jing Securities Co., Ltd.]

23:14.460 --> 23:16.130
[Marketing Director's Office]

23:14.590 --> 23:16.250
Ms. Fang, you wanted to see me?

23:20.170 --> 23:21.260
[Marketing Director's Office]

23:23.320 --> 23:24.840
Never mind. You may leave.

23:24.860 --> 23:29.160
[Marketing Director's Office]

23:25.870 --> 23:26.430
Okay.

23:40.430 --> 23:42.630
That angle was chosen so deliberately.

23:43.400 --> 23:44.680
Who did this?

23:45.930 --> 23:47.960
Isn't it obvious?

23:49.930 --> 23:52.120
Are you trying to say it was my dad?

23:54.230 --> 23:55.030
It seems

23:55.050 --> 23:57.450
your dad really wants you to go home.

23:57.790 --> 23:59.950
He pressured the management

24:00.360 --> 24:02.290
and interfered with your project—

24:02.470 --> 24:04.820
none of that ever worked.

24:05.070 --> 24:07.230
Now he's making up rumors about you.

24:08.180 --> 24:09.810
I'm not some celebrity.

24:09.840 --> 24:11.530
If he wants to make up rumors, let him.

24:11.530 --> 24:12.260
Will it work?

24:12.690 --> 24:13.690
Of course it will.

24:15.160 --> 24:16.960
You know who this girl is, right?

24:19.070 --> 24:20.930
Isn't she that clerk from He Jing?

24:22.260 --> 24:23.060
What?

24:23.460 --> 24:25.370
Are you saying I colluded with He Jing

24:25.370 --> 24:26.470
and deliberately cost our company

24:26.470 --> 24:28.740
the lead underwriter position
on the Shanlifang project?

24:28.740 --> 24:30.570
It's not impossible.

24:31.400 --> 24:32.470
Let's get it straight.

24:32.470 --> 24:35.070
This project originally
belonged to Huang Shusong.

24:35.070 --> 24:36.690
We only lost because he got arrested.

24:36.690 --> 24:38.050
What does that have to do with me?

24:38.050 --> 24:39.710
But that's exactly the issue.

24:39.830 --> 24:40.890
I just looked it up.

24:41.150 --> 24:43.230
Do you know what this girl's

24:43.250 --> 24:44.240
Weibo username is?

24:44.240 --> 24:45.070
How would I know?

24:45.070 --> 24:46.380
I don't even know her at all.

24:46.380 --> 24:47.860
It's Back-office Dumbo.

24:48.270 --> 24:49.920
Over the past few months,

24:49.940 --> 24:53.330
she posted a lot of content
exposing Huang Shusong.

24:55.610 --> 24:56.870
Are you sure, Qian Fei?

24:58.730 --> 25:00.850
She must have found the problem

25:01.020 --> 25:02.220
through public data.

25:03.750 --> 25:05.260
So she's quite capable.

25:08.030 --> 25:08.760
No wonder...

25:09.470 --> 25:10.470
No wonder what?

25:11.860 --> 25:14.900
No wonder Fang Yun
asked a back-office employee

25:14.920 --> 25:16.620
to do the interview on her behalf.

25:16.620 --> 25:17.480
Think about it.

25:17.600 --> 25:19.960
If Huang Shusong takes revenge,

25:20.630 --> 25:22.290
Fang Yun can push all the blame

25:22.290 --> 25:23.810
onto Qian Fei,

25:23.970 --> 25:25.810
and make her the scapegoat.

25:28.280 --> 25:29.940
Fang Yun is really something.

25:30.550 --> 25:31.190
By the way.

25:33.000 --> 25:35.120
I think I just saw that she quit.

25:35.140 --> 25:37.000
Could it be because of this photo?

25:37.700 --> 25:39.230
What happens inside He Jing

25:39.230 --> 25:40.850
is their own business.

25:40.880 --> 25:42.460
But now that you're involved,

25:42.460 --> 25:43.890
that's a different story.

25:43.890 --> 25:45.690
What if they suspect

25:45.720 --> 25:48.340
you have something to do
with the report about Huang Shusong?

25:48.340 --> 25:49.350
That's even more ridiculous!

25:49.350 --> 25:50.160
Don't get worked up.

25:50.160 --> 25:51.830
This needs to be handled calmly.

25:51.830 --> 25:54.100
The bigger the reaction you show,

25:54.170 --> 25:55.850
the more suspicious you look.

25:58.170 --> 25:59.370
That won't do either.

25:59.750 --> 26:01.230
I need to go talk some sense

26:01.230 --> 26:02.230
into that old man.

26:02.320 --> 26:03.660
Calm down, young man!

26:06.610 --> 26:08.610
But I just don't get it.

26:08.630 --> 26:11.170
With your strong working ability,

26:11.300 --> 26:13.580
how could you be the one getting laid off?

26:14.870 --> 26:17.470
Could it be Wang Ruohai pulling strings?

26:17.740 --> 26:20.740
No. It's just an internal company issue.

26:22.270 --> 26:23.730
Someone is targeting you?

26:23.870 --> 26:25.800
Tell me who it is
and I'll stand up for you.

26:25.800 --> 26:26.800
No need.

26:27.140 --> 26:29.940
The company will give me what I'm owed.

26:31.460 --> 26:33.850
I'll just find another job.

26:33.870 --> 26:35.550
You can't just say that.

26:35.570 --> 26:37.260
Breaking up with that jerk

26:37.280 --> 26:39.720
is something worth throwing a party for.

26:39.750 --> 26:41.190
But losing a job is different.

26:41.190 --> 26:43.290
Losing a job means it's harder
to pay the home loan.

26:43.290 --> 26:45.380
And if the bank repossesses
your flat one day,

26:45.380 --> 26:47.250
that's when things truly fall apart.

26:47.250 --> 26:48.100
A while ago,

26:48.130 --> 26:49.870
I rented out the spare room.

26:50.160 --> 26:50.830
And plus

26:50.850 --> 26:52.080
the three months' severance pay

26:52.080 --> 26:54.420
my company gave me.

26:54.450 --> 26:56.880
I think I should be okay for now.

26:57.720 --> 26:58.580
Are you sure?

26:59.900 --> 27:02.220
You and your ex
were already stretched thin

27:02.220 --> 27:03.150
splitting the mortgage.

27:03.150 --> 27:05.410
Now you're relying on these by yourself?

27:05.970 --> 27:07.770
That's not going to work, right?

27:08.560 --> 27:09.870
That's why

27:09.890 --> 27:12.620
I think it's time for me
to move into a front-office role.

27:12.620 --> 27:13.930
The pay is better.

27:14.150 --> 27:15.210
Men are unreliable.

27:15.210 --> 27:17.220
I've got to focus on my career.

27:17.600 --> 27:19.680
You finally figured it out.

27:20.060 --> 27:22.080
It's better late than never.

27:22.920 --> 27:25.860
But you don't have
any front-office experience.

27:25.890 --> 27:27.750
Will it be easy to make the switch?

27:27.770 --> 27:30.380
Director Fang has been
pretty supportive of my abilities.

27:30.380 --> 27:32.570
So I think I should be fine.

27:33.210 --> 27:35.170
I believe you'll be just fine.

27:38.710 --> 27:39.550
Li.

27:41.190 --> 27:41.990
Li.

27:43.690 --> 27:44.290
Li.

27:44.310 --> 27:44.840
I'm here.

27:47.220 --> 27:47.950
You're back.

27:49.810 --> 27:51.020
Tell me the truth.

27:52.250 --> 27:53.580
Did you take that photo?

27:55.240 --> 27:56.060
What photo?

27:56.240 --> 27:57.390
Don't play dumb with me.

27:57.390 --> 27:59.190
You know what I'm talking about.

28:01.360 --> 28:02.090
Oh, that one.

28:05.100 --> 28:07.800
If I said it wasn't me,
would you believe me?

28:07.820 --> 28:09.550
Would you believe it yourself?

28:10.140 --> 28:12.030
Aren't you the one
who hires people every day

28:12.030 --> 28:13.760
to keep tabs on my private life?

28:13.800 --> 28:14.770
I am your father.

28:14.930 --> 28:16.590
For me to check on your private life

28:16.590 --> 28:19.020
is perfectly normal and natural.

28:19.130 --> 28:20.060
But I would never

28:20.070 --> 28:22.160
expose your private life to the public

28:22.160 --> 28:24.920
and damage your reputation.

28:24.950 --> 28:25.470
Am I...

28:27.000 --> 28:28.530
really that twisted to you?

28:35.400 --> 28:37.200
If it wasn't you, then who was it?

28:37.710 --> 28:39.320
Figure it out yourself.

28:44.970 --> 28:46.850
Son, look at you.

28:48.820 --> 28:52.240
You studied abroad for a few years,

28:52.320 --> 28:54.970
worked on a few small projects
at an investment bank,

28:54.970 --> 28:57.070
and invested in a small startup company.

28:57.070 --> 28:59.260
I thought you had grown up,

29:00.020 --> 29:01.020
but I was wrong.

29:02.150 --> 29:03.500
You are still a kid.

29:03.530 --> 29:05.060
When something goes wrong,

29:05.430 --> 29:07.870
instead of thinking it through calmly,

29:07.890 --> 29:09.950
you storm here to accuse me

29:10.150 --> 29:11.740
without a second thought.

29:11.990 --> 29:12.830
You...

29:15.600 --> 29:17.060
Maybe this is a good thing.

29:17.350 --> 29:19.350
It might be a good thing in disguise.

29:19.420 --> 29:21.020
Why don't you come back?

29:22.220 --> 29:23.710
Come back to Qiansheng Group.

29:23.710 --> 29:24.750
After all,

29:24.780 --> 29:27.310
Qiansheng Group is a globally recognized

29:27.330 --> 29:29.450
electronics contract manufacturer.

29:29.450 --> 29:32.310
Our equipment and technology are new.

29:32.340 --> 29:34.260
It's better than struggling
out there on your own.

29:34.260 --> 29:36.170
Alright. You've said is a thousand times.

29:36.170 --> 29:37.510
Your so-called new technology

29:37.510 --> 29:39.060
is all licensed from someone else.

29:39.060 --> 29:40.750
That's always been your biggest weakness.

29:40.750 --> 29:42.740
Come back and talk about being new

29:42.760 --> 29:44.250
when you have your own IP ownership.

29:44.250 --> 29:45.580
I'm done talking to you.

29:47.160 --> 29:48.470
Leaving so soon?

29:50.070 --> 29:51.060
Do you want me to look into it?

29:51.060 --> 29:51.580
No need.

30:00.270 --> 30:01.200
President Li...

30:04.350 --> 30:05.950
He forgot to take his tea egg.

30:06.010 --> 30:06.530
Quick, quick!

30:06.530 --> 30:07.330
Quick, quick!

30:07.460 --> 30:09.190
See if you can catch up with him.

30:17.670 --> 30:19.680
[No stocking on public stairs]

30:19.050 --> 30:19.870
Qian Fei.

30:22.820 --> 30:24.340
Why are you standing out here?

30:24.300 --> 30:27.170
[No stocking on public stairs]

30:24.360 --> 30:25.560
You're finally back.

30:25.630 --> 30:27.600
I... I need a favor.

30:27.620 --> 30:28.420
What's wrong?

30:29.650 --> 30:31.090
Please tell Li Yifei

30:31.120 --> 30:32.810
that I want to break up with him.

30:32.810 --> 30:33.850
Breaking up?

30:34.000 --> 30:34.720
Why?

30:35.990 --> 30:37.470
I'm sure you can tell.

30:37.580 --> 30:39.910
We've been drifting apart for a long time.

30:42.920 --> 30:44.730
But what really made up my mind

30:44.750 --> 30:45.710
was this photo.

30:47.590 --> 30:49.170
What... what photo is this?

30:49.230 --> 30:50.350
This has to be photoshopped!

30:50.350 --> 30:51.190
Trust me.

30:51.190 --> 30:53.670
-There’s nothing between me and Li Yifei.
-It doesn’t matter.

30:53.670 --> 30:55.660
What matters is that
when I saw this photo,

30:55.660 --> 30:57.200
[No stocking on public stairs]

30:55.710 --> 30:57.580
I felt absolutely nothing.

30:59.280 --> 31:01.600
My passport is still with him.

31:01.620 --> 31:03.040
When you tell him,

31:03.310 --> 31:04.730
please get it back for me.

31:06.120 --> 31:08.050
You are going to Milan, aren't you?

31:20.350 --> 31:22.870
Gui Lili told me Li Yifei has a temper.

31:23.510 --> 31:25.490
If he loses it after hearing the breakup,

31:25.490 --> 31:27.290
all my furniture will be ruined.

31:27.640 --> 31:29.570
I haven't covered the deposit hole yet.

31:29.570 --> 31:31.300
I can't afford any more losses.

32:22.570 --> 32:23.580
Landlord.

32:24.210 --> 32:25.220
Landlord.

32:27.520 --> 32:29.340
Landlord, I need to talk to you.

32:29.610 --> 32:31.650
What? You're so loud.

32:33.830 --> 32:35.110
Well...

32:35.540 --> 32:37.180
You... you lost your job?

32:40.040 --> 32:41.860
Yeah. How did you know?

32:42.900 --> 32:44.100
Why were you laid off?

32:44.500 --> 32:46.360
Did it have anything to do with me?

32:46.590 --> 32:48.510
Don't flatter yourself.

32:48.790 --> 32:50.810
You know what Xinyao is like.

32:50.840 --> 32:52.410
She's always worried I'll take her spot,

32:52.410 --> 32:54.340
so she's been giving me a hard time.

32:54.620 --> 32:56.120
It really had nothing to do with me?

32:56.120 --> 32:57.980
How could you possibly affect me?

32:59.150 --> 33:00.410
You didn't tell anyone

33:00.470 --> 33:01.980
we're roommates, right?

33:02.180 --> 33:02.780
No.

33:04.720 --> 33:06.920
So there's no reason for you to move out.

33:07.020 --> 33:08.430
Who said I was moving?

33:12.150 --> 33:15.010
If you're not moving,
where's all this stuff going?

33:16.300 --> 33:17.710
I was cleaning up.

33:18.450 --> 33:20.110
Haven't you heard the saying—

33:21.550 --> 33:23.590
tidying up your space means

33:23.620 --> 33:25.400
tidying up your mind and your life.

33:25.400 --> 33:27.150
If you want to change your life,
change the world,

33:27.150 --> 33:29.480
the first thing to do is
to tidy your room.

33:32.150 --> 33:33.370
Not bad, landlord.

33:34.020 --> 33:35.620
You said I wasn't influencing you,

33:35.620 --> 33:37.820
yet you're quoting things just like me.

33:38.540 --> 33:40.730
Bad habits spread faster than good ones.

33:40.730 --> 33:42.540
Then you clearly haven't learned enough.

33:42.540 --> 33:44.950
Tell you what, I'll give you a chance.

33:45.200 --> 33:46.830
Become my student right now,

33:47.510 --> 33:49.560
and I'll teach you a few more tricks.

33:50.230 --> 33:51.700
We're on the same level.

33:51.830 --> 33:53.660
We still have to share an apartment,

33:53.660 --> 33:55.120
and you want to be my tutor?

33:55.340 --> 33:58.020
What did you say? We're on the same level?

33:59.150 --> 34:02.150
You've got the nerve
to say we're on the same level!

34:02.150 --> 34:04.470
I'm the leader of the Shanlifang project.

34:04.470 --> 34:05.670
Yet you're saying...

34:05.850 --> 34:07.400
If Huang Shusong hadn't gotten arrested,

34:07.400 --> 34:10.130
you wouldn't have been
pulled in as a last resort.

34:11.409 --> 34:13.469
I looked up Zhizhong Capital before,

34:13.530 --> 34:15.489
and I had never heard about you.

34:15.510 --> 34:17.840
That's because I keep a low profile, okay?

34:18.000 --> 34:19.130
Putting that aside,

34:19.400 --> 34:21.050
at the very least, I can teach you

34:21.050 --> 34:23.250
how to avoid getting sidelined at work.

34:23.340 --> 34:24.139
No need.

34:24.350 --> 34:26.480
I don't want to learn office politics.

34:26.880 --> 34:29.389
Fine, just wait.

34:29.620 --> 34:33.050
One day you'll be begging me

34:33.170 --> 34:34.699
to take you on as my student.

34:35.219 --> 34:36.820
I doubt that'll ever happen.

34:40.150 --> 34:42.510
Actually, there is something
I'd like to ask you.

34:42.510 --> 34:43.429
Really?

34:43.960 --> 34:45.440
Already asking for help?

34:47.040 --> 34:47.570
Go ahead.

34:51.389 --> 34:52.630
Have you...

34:53.600 --> 34:55.480
ever rented a red car?

34:55.679 --> 34:56.400
No.

34:58.240 --> 35:00.370
Then, were you a ride-hailing driver?

35:01.550 --> 35:03.870
No. Why are you asking?

35:05.230 --> 35:06.030
It's nothing.

35:07.750 --> 35:09.950
Well, you're hinting at something.

35:10.030 --> 35:10.860
What?

35:11.030 --> 35:13.690
Did you learn
how to beat around the bush from me?

35:13.830 --> 35:14.940
Just say it directly.

35:14.940 --> 35:15.810
Then I'll say it!

35:15.810 --> 35:16.530
Go ahead!

35:17.340 --> 35:19.070
Where did this photo come from?

35:39.370 --> 35:40.770
[Beicui Road]

35:52.630 --> 35:54.090
How did you get this photo?

35:55.120 --> 35:56.780
So you knew about it all along?

35:56.790 --> 35:57.790
What's going on?

35:58.810 --> 35:59.620
No, you tell me first.

35:59.620 --> 36:00.860
Who sent this to you?

36:04.390 --> 36:05.920
Move, let me see who sent it.

36:06.680 --> 36:07.640
Gui Lili?

36:06.760 --> 36:07.780
[Gui Lili]

36:08.410 --> 36:10.270
Wait. Why did she send this to you?

36:10.910 --> 36:11.950
Nothing.

36:22.840 --> 36:23.630
Do you want to have some water first?

36:23.630 --> 36:25.800
Stop talking nonsense
and get to the point!

36:25.800 --> 36:26.680
Say it!

36:32.430 --> 36:33.390
Well...

36:35.860 --> 36:40.780
Gui Lili asked me to tell you

36:40.830 --> 36:42.990
that she wants to break up with you.

36:45.360 --> 36:46.560
What's her reason?

36:49.280 --> 36:51.720
She said you two have different interests.

36:51.750 --> 36:53.090
Trying to accommodate
each other is exhausting,

36:53.090 --> 36:54.450
so she wants to break up.

36:56.440 --> 36:57.840
Accommodate each other?

36:59.550 --> 37:01.810
I'm the one who always accommodates her.

37:05.630 --> 37:06.870
So can you explain

37:06.900 --> 37:08.700
what's going on with this photo?

37:12.120 --> 37:12.920
This?

37:13.240 --> 37:14.470
Tell me!

37:14.870 --> 37:15.990
Who took it?

37:16.010 --> 37:17.390
When was I ever in your car?

37:17.390 --> 37:18.350
Did you drug me?

37:18.350 --> 37:19.280
Why can't I remember any of this?

37:19.280 --> 37:19.880
Drug you?

37:20.260 --> 37:21.530
No, don't get the wrong idea.

37:21.530 --> 37:22.410
Let me explain.

37:22.440 --> 37:24.190
First, delete that photo. Delete it.

37:24.190 --> 37:25.200
Why should I delete it?

37:25.200 --> 37:25.930
Give it to me!

37:48.420 --> 37:50.580
I've already told you the truth.

37:51.110 --> 37:52.310
I'm sorry.

37:52.340 --> 37:54.460
I shouldn't have kept the whole story

37:54.480 --> 37:56.650
from you after you sobered up.

37:56.800 --> 37:57.690
But then again,

37:57.710 --> 37:59.970
we don't have
to be that far apart to talk.

38:00.710 --> 38:03.210
Why would I ever have
any inappropriate thoughts about you?

38:03.210 --> 38:04.480
I could've had feelings for anyone,

38:04.480 --> 38:05.550
but not...

38:06.470 --> 38:09.800
Anyway, I would never do something
like that with any woman.

38:11.480 --> 38:13.190
So you're saying

38:13.220 --> 38:15.280
someone deliberately set you up

38:15.300 --> 38:17.500
and took the photo from a certain angle?

38:20.150 --> 38:21.620
But I have to admit,

38:21.770 --> 38:24.970
I look pretty good in this photo.

38:26.470 --> 38:27.230
Seriously?

38:28.350 --> 38:30.690
Wait. I just remembered something.

38:30.720 --> 38:32.300
I ran into the car owner downstairs

38:32.300 --> 38:33.580
in this neighborhood before.

38:33.580 --> 38:35.400
That's not your car.

38:36.240 --> 38:38.240
A saddle belongs on the right horse.

38:38.290 --> 38:39.420
Stop chasing after something

38:39.420 --> 38:40.680
that was never yours to begin with.

38:40.680 --> 38:42.160
Drop the act, okay?

38:42.190 --> 38:43.990
Yes, yes, I get it.

38:46.450 --> 38:48.490
But who on earth took this photo?

38:48.520 --> 38:49.150
Come on!

38:50.270 --> 38:52.100
Are you still suffering from amnesia?

38:52.100 --> 38:53.700
I've told you a hundred times.

38:53.700 --> 38:55.700
I have no idea who took it!

38:56.170 --> 38:58.550
Anyway, whoever did it,

38:58.570 --> 39:00.700
starting rumors about us is pointless.

39:00.700 --> 39:01.580
Everyone knows

39:01.600 --> 39:03.390
there's absolutely no way for me

39:03.390 --> 39:05.220
to have a relationship
with a woman like you.

39:05.220 --> 39:06.300
A woman like me?

39:06.320 --> 39:07.690
A woman...

39:09.630 --> 39:11.850
whose talent far exceeds her looks!

40:56.730 --> 40:57.460
[Gui Lili]

41:02.260 --> 41:02.780
Hello?

41:03.240 --> 41:04.920
Did... did you talk to him?

41:05.910 --> 41:07.030
I did.

41:09.880 --> 41:10.880
Is he still there?

41:11.410 --> 41:12.850
I'm downstairs now.

41:14.820 --> 41:16.540
He is, but he's still asleep.

41:16.560 --> 41:17.680
He hasn't gotten up yet.

41:17.680 --> 41:20.070
All your stuff is piled up
outside his door.

41:20.070 --> 41:22.290
Okay. I'll come up and get it.

41:22.650 --> 41:24.170
Alright. Just keep your voice down.

41:24.170 --> 41:24.970
Be quiet.

41:40.210 --> 41:41.050
Morning.

41:42.530 --> 41:43.060
Morning.

41:43.060 --> 41:43.590
Morning.

41:47.140 --> 41:48.540
Taking the day off today?

41:48.540 --> 41:49.590
Yeah.

41:50.160 --> 41:51.690
Then why are you up so early?

41:52.250 --> 41:54.450
I'm going downstairs to buy breakfast.

41:54.800 --> 41:56.660
You... you're going downstairs?

41:56.670 --> 41:57.750
Don't.

41:58.590 --> 41:59.650
Why go downstairs?

41:59.660 --> 42:01.840
One word from you and I'll cook for you.

42:02.010 --> 42:03.800
You don't have to do a thing.

42:03.830 --> 42:05.340
I'll cook and bring it right to your room.

42:05.340 --> 42:06.590
Just stay in bed and rest.

42:06.590 --> 42:08.250
I'll call you when it's ready.

42:08.900 --> 42:10.130
Now go back to sleep.

42:13.640 --> 42:15.250
Who are you, exactly?

42:15.470 --> 42:17.220
Taking care of me for no reason?

42:18.120 --> 42:19.720
I'm doing this out of pity...

42:20.540 --> 42:22.400
Well, you just got dumped.

42:22.430 --> 42:24.970
And I know exactly how that feels.

42:24.990 --> 42:26.060
I really do.

42:26.090 --> 42:27.530
I know you're hurting.

42:31.030 --> 42:33.750
Fried egg, bacon, toast, and coffee.

42:33.780 --> 42:34.740
Okay?

42:35.970 --> 42:36.610
Okay.

42:36.630 --> 42:38.640
Alright, now go back inside.

42:38.660 --> 42:39.610
Then I'll go back to sleep.

42:39.610 --> 42:40.210
Go, go, go.

42:40.570 --> 42:41.630
Alright, alright.

42:41.900 --> 42:42.830
Go get some rest.

42:46.300 --> 42:47.890
I want a sunny-side-up egg.

42:48.110 --> 42:48.950
Got it.

42:52.200 --> 42:53.700
[In the next episode
of "Love Has Fireworks"]

42:54.040 --> 42:56.440
You're leaving because I don't have money.

42:56.990 --> 42:58.690
You give me neither financial security

42:58.690 --> 42:59.870
nor emotional support.

42:59.870 --> 43:01.360
Why should I stay with you?

43:02.470 --> 43:03.470
Stop right there.

43:03.770 --> 43:05.770
With your qualifications,
you'll need to intern for a year first

43:05.770 --> 43:07.060
to get the front-office job.

43:07.060 --> 43:08.070
The starting salary is 3,000 yuan a month.

43:08.070 --> 43:09.230
Can you accept it?

43:09.750 --> 43:11.750
As long as you ask me to be your tutor,

43:11.850 --> 43:12.390
and I'll...

43:12.390 --> 43:13.380
No need.

43:13.630 --> 43:15.920
I already have someone I look up to,

43:16.420 --> 43:18.150
and she's much better than you.

43:18.790 --> 43:19.790
Who?
